catalogue-also algorithms
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/alg
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics pseudocode

name algobox
category Package
revision 67201
shortdesc Typeset Algobox programs
longdesc This LaTeX package can typeset Algobox programs almost exactly
longdesc as displayed when editing with Algobox itself, using an input
longdesc syntax very similar to the actual Algobox program text. It
longdesc gives better results than Algobox's own LaTeX export which does
longdesc not look like the editor rendition, produces standalone
longdesc documents cumbersome to customize, and has arbitrary and
longdesc inconsistent differences between the input syntax and the
longdesc program text. This package depends upon the following other
longdesc LaTeX packages: expl3, TikZ, environ, xparse, and xcolor.
docfiles size=39
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/algobox/LICENSE
