name antique-spanish-units
category Package
revision 69568
shortdesc A short document about antique spanish units
longdesc This short document is about antique spanish units used in
longdesc Spain and their colonies between the sixteenth and nineteenth
longdesc centuries. The next step will be to develop a LaTeX package
longdesc similar to siunitx. The document could be interesting for
longdesc historians, economists, metrologists and others, as a reference
longdesc and detailed compendium about this old system of units.
docfiles size=64
 texmf-dist/doc/generic/antique-spanish-units/README details="Readme"
