name apa6
category Package
revision 67848
shortdesc Format documents in APA style (6th edition)
longdesc The class formats documents in APA style (6th Edition). It
longdesc provides a full set of facilities in three different output
longdesc modes (journal-like appearance, double-spaced manuscript,
longdesc LaTeX-like document), in contrast to the earlier apa6e, which
longdesc only formats double-spaced manuscripts in APA style. The class
longdesc can mask author identity for copies for use in masked peer
longdesc review. The class is a development of the apa class (which is
longdesc no longer maintained).
