name armtex
category Package
revision 69418
shortdesc A system for writing in Armenian with TeX and LaTeX
longdesc ArmTeX is a system for typesetting Armenian text with Plain TeX
longdesc or LaTeX(2e). It may be used with input: from a standard Latin
longdesc keyboard without any special encoding and/or support for
longdesc Armenian letters, from any keyboard which uses an encoding that
longdesc has Armenian letters in the second half (characters 128-255) of
longdesc the extended ASCII table (for example ArmSCII8 Armenian
longdesc standard), from an Armenian keyboard using UTF-8 encoding.
longdesc Users should note that the manuals still mostly describe the
longdesc previous version of the package (ArmTeX 2.0). However, a
longdesc description of the new features of ArmTeX 3.0 is provided at
longdesc the end of the README file.
execute addMixedMap arss.map
execute addMixedMap artm.map
