name autotype
category Package
revision 69309
shortdesc A LuaLaTeX package for automatic language-specific typography
longdesc autotype is a LuaLaTeX package for automatic language-specific
longdesc typography. Currently, it supports ligature suppression at word
longdesc boundaries, long s insertion for blackletter typesetting, and
longdesc weighted hyphenation, but only for German (old and new
longdesc orthography).
