name bchart
category Package
revision 43928
shortdesc Draw simple bar charts in LaTeX
longdesc The package provides horizontal bar charts, drawn using TikZ on
longdesc a numeric X-axis. The focus of the package is simplicity and
longdesc aesthetics.
