name beuron
category Package
revision 46374
shortdesc The script of the Beuronese art school
longdesc This package provides the script used in the works of the
longdesc Beuron art school for use with TeX and LaTeX. It is a
longdesc monumental script consisting of capital letters only. The fonts
longdesc are provided as Metafont sources, in the Type1 and in the
longdesc OpenType format. The package includes suitable font selection
longdesc commands for use with LaTeX.
