name bguq
category Package
revision 27401
shortdesc Improved quantifier stroke for Begriffsschrift packages
longdesc The font contains a single character: the Begriffsschrift
longdesc quantifier (in several sizes), as used to set the
longdesc Begriffsschrift (concept notation) of Frege. The font is not
longdesc intended for end users; instead it is expected that it will be
longdesc used by other packages which implement the Begriffsschrift. An
longdesc (unofficial) modified version of Josh Parsons' begriff is
longdesc included as an example of implementation.
execute addMap bguq.map
