name biblatex-arthistory-bonn
category Package
revision 46637
shortdesc BibLaTeX citation style covers the citation and bibliography guidelines for art historians
longdesc This citation style covers the citation and bibliography
longdesc guidelines of the Kunsthistorisches Institut der Universitat
longdesc Bonn for undergraduates. It introduces bibliography entry types
longdesc for catalogs and features a tabular bibliography, among other
longdesc things. Various options are available to change and adjust the
longdesc outcome according to one's own preferences. The style is
longdesc compatible with English and German.
docfiles size=67
