shortdesc Chicago style files for BibLaTeX
longdesc This is a BibLaTeX style that implements the Chicago
longdesc 'author-date' and 'notes with bibliography' style
longdesc specifications given in the Chicago Manual of Style, 17th
longdesc edition (with continuing support for the 16th edition, too).
