name biblatex-true-citepages-omit
category Package
revision 44653
shortdesc Correction of some limitation of the citepages=omit option of BibLaTeX styles
longdesc This package deals with a limitation of the citepages=omit
longdesc option of the verbose family of BibLaTeX citestyles. The option
longdesc works when you \cite[xx]{key}, but not when you \cite[\pno~xx,
longdesc some text]{key}. The package corrects this problem.
