name bibleref-parse
category Package
revision 22054
shortdesc Specify Bible passages in human-readable format
longdesc The package parses Bible passages that are given in human
longdesc readable format. It accepts a wide variety of formats. This
longdesc allows for a simpler and more convenient interface to the
longdesc functionality of the bibleref package.
