name boisik
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc A font inspired by Baskerville design
longdesc Boisik is a serif font set (inspired by the Baskerville
longdesc typeface), written in Metafont. The set comprises roman and
longdesc italic text fonts and maths fonts. LaTeX support is offered for
longdesc use with OT1, IL2 and OM* encodings.
