name bxjalipsum
category Package
revision 67620
shortdesc Dummy text in Japanese
longdesc This package enables users to print some Japanese text that can
longdesc be used as dummy text. It is a Japanese counterpart of the
longdesc lipsum package. Since there is no well-known nonsense text like
longdesc Lipsum in the Japanese language, the package uses some real
longdesc text in public domain.
