name cartonaugh
category Package
revision 59938
shortdesc A LuaLaTeX package for drawing karnaugh maps with up to 6 variables
longdesc This package, a fork of 2pi's karnaugh-map package, draws
longdesc karnaugh maps with 2, 3, 4, 5, and 6 variables. It also
longdesc contains commands for filling the karnaugh map with terms
longdesc semi-automatically or manually. Last but not least it contains
longdesc commands for drawing implicants on top of the map. The name
longdesc "cartonaugh" is a portmanteau of "cartographer" and "karnaugh".
longdesc The package needs LuaLaTeX and depends on TikZ, xparse, and
longdesc xstring.
docfiles size=53
