name chbibref
category Package
revision 17120
shortdesc Change the Bibliography/References title
longdesc Defines a single command, \setbibref, which sets whichever of
longdesc \bibname and \refname is in use. (\bibname is used in book.cls
longdesc and report.cls, and \refname is used in article.cls.)
