name chemsec
category Package
revision 46972
shortdesc Automated creation of numeric entity labels
longdesc Packages provides creation of sequential numeric labels for
longdesc entities in a document. The motivating example is chemical
longdesc structures in a scientific document. The package can
longdesc automatically output a full object name and label on the first
longdesc occurence in the document and just labels only on subsequent
longdesc references.
