revision 74373
shortdesc TikZ-based package for drawing customisable timelines with support for colour schemes, styles and memoization
longdesc The package supports drawing timelines and aims to be highly
longdesc customisable. Extensive configuration options are offered via a
longdesc standard key-value interface based on pgfkeys. Custom colour
longdesc schemes and styles are supported, and the package includes
longdesc documented examples of each. Memoization works out-of-the-box
longdesc if the memoize package is loaded. The code was developed as a
longdesc result of questions concerning difficulties in customising the
longdesc output of existing packages for drawing timelines, which
longdesc sometimes eschew pgfkeys and are often challenging to
longdesc configure, even when based on PGF/TikZ.
docfiles size=670
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/chronos/README.md details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/chronos/chronos.pdf details="Package documentation"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/chronos/chronos.tex
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/chronos/manifest.txt
runfiles size=69
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/chronos/chronos-lib-colschemes.sty
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/chronos/chronos-lib-styles.sty
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/chronos/chronos.sty
