name classicthesis
category Package
revision 73676
shortdesc A "classically styled" thesis package
longdesc This package provides an elegant layout designed in homage to
longdesc Bringhurst's "The Elements of Typographic Style". It makes use
longdesc of a range of techniques to get the best results achievable
longdesc using TeX. Included in the bundle are templates to make thesis
longdesc writing easier.
