name cmtiup
category Package
revision 39728
shortdesc Upright punctuation with CM italic
longdesc The cmtiup fonts address a problem with the appearance of
longdesc punctuation in italic text in mathematical documents. To
longdesc achieve this, all punctuation characters are upright, and
longdesc kerning between letters and punctuation is adjusted to allow
longdesc for the italic correction. The fonts are implemented as a set
longdesc of vf files; a package for support in LaTeX 2e is provided.
