catalogue-topics font font-body font-serif font-multilingual font-greek font-cyrillic font-proportional font-otf font-type1 font-t1enc font-supp
catalogue-version 1.085

name codeanatomy
category Package
revision 65648
shortdesc Typeset code with annotations
longdesc The idea of this Package is to typeset illustrations of pieces
longdesc of code with annotations on each single part of code (Code
longdesc Anatomy). The origin of this idea are code illustrations from
longdesc the book "Computer Science: An Interdisciplinary Approach" from
longdesc Robert Sedgewick and Kevin Wayne. The package depends on expl3,
longdesc xparse, and TikZ.
docfiles size=96
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/codeanatomy/README.md details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/codeanatomy/codeanatomy.lstlisting.pdf details="Usage with listings"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/codeanatomy/codeanatomy.lstlisting.tex
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/codeanatomy/codeanatomy.pdf details="Package documentation (Implementation)"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/codeanatomy/codeanatomy.usage.pdf details="Package documentation (Usage)"
