name coelacanth
category Package
revision 64558
shortdesc Coelacanth fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for Coelecanth fonts, designed by Ben Whitmore.
longdesc Coelacanth is inspired by the classic Centaur type design of
longdesc Bruce Rogers, described by some as the most beautiful typeface
longdesc ever designed. It aims to be a professional quality type family
longdesc for general book typesetting.
