name continue
category Package
revision 49449
shortdesc Prints 'continuation' marks on pages of multipage documents
longdesc This package provides for a variety of continuation indicators
longdesc on pages when the text continues on the following page. The
longdesc default is to only mark odd pages, but all pages can be marked
longdesc and the marking can be stopped or started at any point.
