name copyrightbox
category Package
revision 24829
shortdesc Provide copyright notices for images in a document
longdesc The package command \copyrightbox[<placement>]{<image
longdesc command>}{<text>}, which places the text as a copyright notice
longdesc relating to the matter created by the image command.
