name cora-macs
category Package
revision 73101
shortdesc Macros for continuous sets and neural networks in the context of cyber-physical systems
longdesc This LaTeX package has been designed to assist in the
longdesc representation and manipulation of continuous sets, operations,
longdesc neural networks, and color schemes tailored for use in the
longdesc context of cyber-physical systems. It provides a comprehensive
longdesc set of macros that streamline the process of documenting
longdesc complex mathematical objects and operations.
