name csvmerge
category Package
revision 51857
shortdesc Merge TeX code with csv data
longdesc This package provides macros for processing a csv spreadsheet
longdesc file with a minimum of configuration for the csv file. The
longdesc first row names the columns and the remaining rows are data.
longdesc This data can be merged with TeX code residing in an auxiliary
longdesc file and the process repeated for each data row. There is one
longdesc macro to set things up, one to extract the data, and one to
longdesc tell if the field is empty or not. The documentation contains
longdesc examples.
