name culmus
category Package
revision 68495
shortdesc Hebrew fonts from the Culmus project
longdesc Hebrew fonts from the Culmus Project. Both Type1 and
longdesc Open/TrueType versions of the fonts are provided, as well as
longdesc font definition files. It is recomended to use these fonts with
longdesc the NHE8 font encoding, from the hebrew-fonts package.
execute addMap culmus-new.map
execute addMap culmus.map
