name datatool-regions
category Package
revision 74393
shortdesc Region (Numeric) Support for datatool v3.0+
longdesc The datatool-regions bundle provides the language-independent
longdesc region ldf files for the datatool package (v3.0+). The *.ldf
longdesc files should all be placed on TeX's path. These files don't
longdesc require any explicit loading. They will automatically be input
longdesc by datatool-base.sty (or relevant supplementary package) if
longdesc they are found and required by the tracklang localisation
longdesc settings. See the datatool v3.0+ and tracklang user manuals for
longdesc further details. The region files deal with defining the
longdesc currency symbol, and may additionally (if not dependent on the
longdesc language) set the number group and decimal characters, and
longdesc provide functions for parsing numeric dates and times. If a
longdesc pre-3.0 version of datatool is installed, these ldf files will
longdesc be ignored.
depend datatool
