longdesc from the Twelve-Tone System, also called Dodecaphonism. It
longdesc provides LaTeX algorithms that produce typical dodecaphonic
longdesc notation based off a musical series, or row sequence, of
longdesc variable length. The package requires etoolbox, pgfkeys, TikZ,
longdesc xparse, and xstring.
