name delimseasy
category Package
revision 39589
shortdesc Delimiter commands that are easy to use and resize
longdesc This package provides commands to give a consistent,
longdesc easy-to-remember, easy to edit way to control the size and
longdesc blackness of delimiters: append 1-4 "b"s to command for larger
longdesc sizes; prepend "B" for for boldface. These commands reduce the
longdesc likelihood of incomplete delimeter pairs and typically use
longdesc fewer characters than the LaTeX default.
docfiles size=61
