name dpcircling
category Package
revision 54994
shortdesc Decorated text boxes using TikZ
longdesc This simple package provides four types of text decorations
longdesc using TikZ. You can frame your text with circles, rectangles,
longdesc jagged rectangles, and fan-shapes. The baseline will be
longdesc adjusted properly according to the surroundings. You can use
longdesc these decorations both in text mode and in math mode. You can
longdesc specify line color, line width, width, and height using option
longdesc keys. Note: The "DP" in the package name stands for "Decorated
longdesc Packets".
