name drm
category Package
revision 38157
shortdesc A complete family of fonts written in Metafont
longdesc The package provides access to the DRM (Don's Revised Modern)
longdesc family of fonts, which includes a variety of optical sizes in
longdesc Roman (in four weights), italic, and small caps, among other
longdesc shapes, along with a set of symbols and ornaments. It is
longdesc intended to be a full-body text font, but its larger sizes can
longdesc also be used for simple display purposes, and its significant
longdesc body of symbols can stand on its own. It comes complete with
longdesc textual ("old-style") and lining figures, and even has
longdesc small-caps figures. It also comes with extensible decorative
longdesc rules to be used with ornaments from itself or other fonts,
longdesc along with an extremely flexible ellipsis package.
