name dviincl
category Package
revision 29349
shortdesc Include a DVI page into MetaPost output
longdesc DVItoMP is one of the auxiliary programs available to any
longdesc MetaPost package; it converts a DVI file into a MetaPost file.
longdesc Using it, one can envisage including a DVI page into an EPS
longdesc files generated by MetaPost. Such files allow pages to include
longdesc other pages.
