name ebook
category Package
revision 29466
shortdesc Helps creating an ebook by providing an ebook class
longdesc The package defines a command \ebook that defines page layout,
longdesc fonts, and font-sizes for documents to be rendered as
longdesc PDF-ebooks on small ebook-readers. The package has been tested
longdesc with Kindle e-ink and iPad mini.
