name elteiktdk
category Package
revision 71086
shortdesc TDK-thesis template for Hungarian TDK conferences, Section of Computer Science
longdesc The National Conference of Scientific Students Associations
longdesc (OTDK) of Hungary is the most significant scientific event for
longdesc Bachelor and Master students in the country, where students
longdesc compete with their research papers in all field of science. It
longdesc is organized in every 2 years. The conference/competition has 2
longdesc rounds: a university level and a country level (for the best
longdesc papers). This class template enforces the required formatting
longdesc rules for TDK theses and generates the cover and title page
longdesc given on the provided metadata. The formatting rules are
longdesc defined to meet the requirements for TDK theses submitted at
longdesc the Eotvos Lorand University, Faculty of Informatics (Budapest,
longdesc Hungary). This also fits the formatting requirements of the
longdesc Computer Science Section of the country level round. With
longdesc sufficient modifications the template could be usable for TDK
longdesc theses at other national and faculty level sections, too. The
longdesc template supports producing both Hungarian and English theses.
