name eqnlines
category Package
revision 74308
shortdesc Single- and multiline equations
longdesc This LaTeX2e package provides a framework for typesetting
longdesc single- and multiline equations which extends the established
longdesc equation environments of LaTeX and the amsmath package with
longdesc many options for convenient adjustment of the intended layout.
longdesc In particular, the package adds flexible schemes for numbering,
longdesc horizontal alignment and semi-automatic punctuation, and it
longdesc improves upon the horizontal and vertical spacing options. The
longdesc extensions can be used and adjusted through optional arguments
longdesc and modifiers to the equation environments as well as global
longdesc settings.
