longdesc The Adobe Type 1 implementation was generated from the original
longdesc Metafont using mftrace. This distribution does not contain the
longdesc TFM files that are necessary to use the fonts with TeX; the TFM
longdesc files can be generated from the Metafont sources obtained by
longdesc following the instructions in the normal way.
