name exercisesheets
category Package
revision 71063
shortdesc Typeset exercise sheets for university courses and school classes
longdesc This LaTeX package provides a way to typeset exercise sheets as
longdesc used in university courses and school classes. It has evolved
longdesc from a set of macros and environments that were finally
longdesc combined into this package. Since version 0.11 it has a regular
longdesc and a beamer mode (selected depending on the documentclass
longdesc used). From version 0.16 on there is an embedded mode that
longdesc allows using exercises in lecture notes etc. without requiring
longdesc page breaks. Since the package includes a loading mechanism for
longdesc exercises from external files, the same exercises can be reused
longdesc in different contexts.
