name fast-diagram
category Package
revision 29264
shortdesc Easy generation of FAST diagrams
longdesc The package provides simple means of producing FAST diagrams,
longdesc using TikZ/pgf tools. FAST diagrams are useful for functional
longdesc analysis techniques in design methods.
