name fbithesis
category Package
revision 21340
shortdesc Computer Science thesis class for University of Dortmund
longdesc At the department of computer science at the University of
longdesc Dortmund there are cardboard cover pages for research or
longdesc internal reports like master/phd-theses. The main function of
longdesc this LaTeX2e document-class is a replacement for the \maketitle
longdesc command to typeset a title page that is adjusted to these cover
longdesc pages.
