name first-latex-doc
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc A document for absolute LaTeX beginners
longdesc The document leads a reader, who knows nothing about LaTeX,
longdesc through the production of a two page document. The user who has
longdesc completed that first document, and wants to carry on, will find
longdesc recommendations for tutorials.
