catalogue-version 0.04

name fixcmex
category Package
revision 51825
shortdesc Fully scalable version of Computer Modern Math Extension font
longdesc This package provides a fully scalable version of the Computer
longdesc Modern Math Extension font for curing sizing problems mainly
longdesc with lmodern. It can be used when the main font of the document
longdesc is Computer Modern (or European Modern, if T1 encoding is
longdesc selected), or Latin Modern. It redefines the math extension
longdesc font so that it becomes arbitrarily scalable, using the optical
longdesc size fonts provided by the AMS together with the original
longdesc cmex10 font.
