name floatbytocbasic
category Package
revision 67945
shortdesc An enhancement to package float using package tocbasic
longdesc This package adds usage of package tocbasic to package float.
longdesc This not only improves compatibility with KOMA-Script but also
longdesc adds several new features to float like optional automatic
longdesc entries to the table of contents for the lists of new floats,
longdesc optional numbering of the lists of new floats etc.
