name frcursive
category Package
revision 24559
shortdesc French cursive hand fonts
longdesc A hand-writing font in the style of the French academic
longdesc running-hand. The font was written in Metafont and has been
longdesc converted to Adobe Type 1 format. LaTeX support (NFFS fd files,
longdesc and a package) and font maps are provided.
