name ftcap
category Package
revision 17275
shortdesc Allows \caption at the beginning of a table-environment
longdesc For several reasons a \caption may be desirable at the top of a
longdesc table environment. This package changes the table environment
longdesc such that \abovecaptionskip and \belowcaptionskip are swapped.
longdesc The package should also work with a non-standard table
longdesc environment.
