name genealogy
category Package
revision 25112
shortdesc A compilation genealogy font
longdesc A simple compilation of the genealogical symbols found in the
longdesc wasy and gen fonts, adding the male and female symbols to
longdesc Knuth's 'gen' font, and so avoiding loading two fonts when you
longdesc need only genealogical symbols. The font is distributed as
longdesc Metafont source.
