name getmap
category Package
revision 50589
shortdesc Download OpenStreetMap maps for use in documents
longdesc The package provides a simple interface to OpenStreetMap, and
longdesc to Google Maps "map images". In the simplest case, it is
longdesc sufficient to specify the address you need (if you don't, the
longdesc package will use its own default). The package loads the map
longdesc image using an external lua script (invoked via \write 18:
longdesc LaTeX must be running with \write 18 enabled). The ("external")
longdesc lua script may be used from the command line; a bash version is
longdesc provided.
depend getmap.ARCH
