name gillcm
category Package
revision 19878
shortdesc Alternative unslanted italic Computer Modern fonts
longdesc This is a demonstration of the use of virtual fonts for unusual
longdesc effects: the package implements an old idea of Eric Gill. The
longdesc package was written for the author's talk at TUG 2010.
