name git-latexdiff
category Package
revision 54732
shortdesc Call latexdiff on two Git revisions of a file
longdesc git-latexdiff is a tool to graphically visualize differences
longdesc between different versions of a LaTeX file. Technically, it is
longdesc a wrapper around git and latexdiff.
depend git-latexdiff.ARCH
