name gnu-freefont
category Package
revision 68624
shortdesc A Unicode font, with rather wide coverage
longdesc The package provides a set of outline (i.e. OpenType) fonts
longdesc covering as much as possible of the Unicode character set. The
longdesc set consists of three typefaces: one monospaced and two
longdesc proportional (one with uniform and one with modulated stroke).
