name hackthefootline
category Package
revision 46494
shortdesc Footline selection and configuration for LaTeX beamer's standard themes
longdesc This package is taking over, defining and redefining different
longdesc footlines. Configuration is provided via using key-value
longdesc syntax. It depends on the pgfkeys used for providing the
longdesc configuration keys. Optional features require the following
longdesc LaTeX packages: appendixnumberbeamer, calc, etoolbox, and
longdesc numprint.
