shortdesc Boxed Chinese characters with Pinyin above and translation below
longdesc This is a LaTeX package written to simplify the input of
longdesc Chinese with Hanyu Pinyin and translation. Hanyu Pinyin is
longdesc placed above Chinese with the xpinyin package, and the
longdesc translation is placed below. The package can be used as a
longdesc utility for learning to write and pronounce Chinese characters,
longdesc for Chinese character learning plans, presentations, exercise
longdesc booklets and other documentation work.
