name hepnames
category Package
revision 35722
shortdesc Pre-defined high energy particle names
longdesc Hepnames provides a pair of LaTeX packages, heppennames and
longdesc hepnicenames, providing a large set of pre-defined high energy
longdesc physics particle names built with the hepparticles package. The
longdesc packages are based on pennames.sty by Michel Goosens and Eric
longdesc van Herwijnen. Heppennames re-implements the particle names in
longdesc pennames.sty, with some additions and alterations and greater
longdesc flexibility and robustness due to the hepparticles structures,
longdesc which were written for this purpose. Hepnicenames provides the
longdesc main non-resonant particle names from heppennames with more
longdesc "friendly" names.
