name heros-otf
category Package
revision 64695
shortdesc Using the OpenType fonts TeX Gyre Heros>
longdesc This package can only be used with LuaLaTeX or XeLaTeX. It does
longdesc the font setting for the OpenType font 'TeX Gyre Heros'. The
longdesc condensed versions of the fonts are also supported. The missing
longdesc typefaces for slanted text are also defined.
