catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics index
catalogue-version 1.7.0

name indextra
category Package
revision 74327
shortdesc Enhanced index typesetting
longdesc This package provides some enhanced features for typesetting
longdesc indexes, notably: (1) Continuation text when entries or
longdesc sub-entries continue from one page or column to the next. (2)
longdesc An interface for accessing marks created from index entries, so
longdesc that (for example) a running head can include the range of
longdesc index entries that appears on the page.
