name isomath
category Package
revision 27654
shortdesc Mathematics style for science and technology
longdesc The package provides tools for a mathematical style that
longdesc conforms to the International Standard ISO 80000-2 and is
longdesc common in science and technology. It changes the default shape
longdesc of capital Greek letters to italic, sets up bold italic and
longdesc sans-serif bold italic math alphabets with Latin and Greek
longdesc characters, and defines macros for markup of vector, matrix and
longdesc tensor symbols.
