name isopt
category Package
revision 45509
shortdesc Writing a TeX length with a space between number and unit
longdesc Writing a TeX length with \the writes the value and the unit
longdesc without a space. Package isopt provides a macro \ISO which
longdesc inserts a user defined space between number and unit.
