name jablantile
category Package
revision 16364
shortdesc Metafont version of tiles in the style of Slavik Jablan
longdesc This is a small Metafont font to implement the modular tiles
longdesc described by Slavik Jablan. For an outline of the theoretical
longdesc structure of the tiles, see (for example) Jablan's JMM 2006
longdesc Exhibit.
