name jamtimes
category Package
revision 20408
shortdesc Expanded Times Roman fonts
longdesc The package offers LaTeX support for the expanded Times Roman
longdesc font, which has been used for many years in the Journal
longdesc d'Analyse Mathematique. Mathematics support is based on the
longdesc Belleek fonts.
