name japanese-mathformulas
category Package
revision 64678
shortdesc Compiling basic math formulas in Japanese using LuaLaTeX
longdesc This is a style file for compiling basic maths formulas in
longdesc Japanese using LuaLaTeX. \NewDocumentCommand allows you to
longdesc specify whether the formula should be used within a sentence or
longdesc on a new line. The main packages used in
longdesc japanese-mathformulas.sty are amsmath, amssymb, siunitx,
longdesc ifthen, xparse, TikZ, mathtools, and graphics.
