category Package
revision 64797
shortdesc Compile differently based on the filename
longdesc This package allows to compile a document differently depending
longdesc on the portion of the document's file name (internally, the
longdesc \jobname) that comes after the first "-" character. This allows
longdesc one to have one source file and multiple links to this source
longdesc file that each compile differently.
docfiles size=110
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/jobname-suffix/README.md details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/jobname-suffix/jobname-suffix.pdf details="Package documentation"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/jobname-suffix/jobname-suffix.tex
runfiles size=1
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/jobname-suffix/jobname-suffix.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/siefkenj/jobname-suffix/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/siefkenj/jobname-suffix
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/jobname-suffix
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics compilation
catalogue-version 1.0

name joinbox
category Package
revision 72239
shortdesc Join boxes vertically or horizontally
longdesc This package can join boxes vertically or horizontally. When
longdesc using vertical joining, all boxes to be joined will keep same
longdesc width, while when using horizontal joined, all boxes to be
longdesc joined keep same height.
