name kanaparser
category Package
revision 48052
shortdesc Kana parser for LuaTeX
longdesc The package provides a kana parser for LuaTeX. It is a set of 4
longdesc macros that handle transliteration of text: from hiragana and
longdesc katakana to Latin from Latin and katakana to hiragana from
longdesc Latin and hiragana to katakana It can be used to write kana
longdesc directly using only the ASCII character set or for education
longdesc purposes. The package has support for obsolete and rarely used
longdesc syllables, some only accessible via the provided toggle macro.
