name ksfh_nat
category Package
revision 24825
catalogue ksfh-nat
shortdesc BibTeX style for KSFH Munich
longdesc The package supports bibliographies as standard for KSFH
longdesc (Katholische Stiftungsfachhochschule) Munich. BibTeX entries in
longdesc article, book, inbook, incollection and misc formats are
longdesc supported.
