name kurdishlipsum
category Package
revision 47518
shortdesc A 'lipsum' package for the Kurdish language
longdesc This package provides lipsum-like facilities for the Kurdish
longdesc language. The package gives you easy access to the Kurdish
longdesc poetry and balladry texts of the Diwany Vafaiy, Ahmedy Xani,
longdesc Naly, Mahwy,.... The package needs to be run under XeLaTeX.
