name labelschanged
category Package
revision 69400
shortdesc Identify labels which cause endless "may have changed" warnings
longdesc Several conditions can cause LaTeX labels to keep changing, no
longdesc matter how many times a document is recompiled. This package
longdesc helps diagnose the cause of repeated "Label(s) may have
longdesc changed" warnings. The names and before/after definitions of
longdesc changing labels are printed at the end of each compile.
longdesc Multiply-defined labels are printed as well.
