name layaureo
category Package
revision 19087
shortdesc A package to improve the A4 page layout
longdesc This package produces a wide page layout for documents that use
longdesc A4 paper size. Moreover, LayAureo provides both a simple hook
longdesc for leaving an empty space which is required if pages are
longdesc bundled by a press binding (use option binding=length), and an
longdesc option called big which it forces typearea to become maximum.
