name libgreek
category Package
revision 65004
shortdesc Greek letters in math mode from Libertinus or Linux Libertine/Biolinum
longdesc This package allows LaTeX users (especially if using
longdesc traditional LaTeX/pdfLaTeX) to set the Greek letters in math
longdesc mode using the glyphs from the Libertinus Serif or Sans font
longdesc via the font support files provided by Bob Tennent's
longdesc libertinus-type1 package. All Greek letters are defined both in
longdesc \...up and \...it variants. The style (ISO, TeX, or French i.e.
longdesc upright) can be modified midway in the document. A "legacy"
longdesc mode uses font support from the (obsolete) libertine-legacy
longdesc package which maps to the Linux Libertine or Biolinum fonts.
longdesc This package is for users who only want to customize Greek
longdesc letters in math mode.
docfiles size=42
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/libgreek/README details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/libgreek/libgreek.pdf details="Package documentation"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/libgreek/libgreek.tex
