name librebodoni
category Package
revision 64431
shortdesc Libre Bodoni fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc The Libre Bodoni fonts are designed by Pablo Impallari and
longdesc Rodrigo Fuenzalida, based on the 19th century Morris Fuller
longdesc Benton's.
