name ltb2bib
category Package
revision 43746
shortdesc Converts amsrefs' .ltb bibliographical databases to BibTeX format
longdesc This package implements a LaTeX command that converts an
longdesc amsrefs bibliographical database (.ltb) to a BibTeX
longdesc bibliographical database (.bib). ltb2bib is the reverse of the
longdesc "amsxport" option in amsrefs. Typical uses are: produce bib
longdesc entries for some publishers which don't accept amsrefs (Taylor
longdesc & Francis, for example); import an ltb database in a database
longdesc management program, e.g. for sorting; access one's ltb database
longdesc within emacs's RefTeX mode.
