name luahttp
category Package
revision 67348
shortdesc Compile-time internet-interactive PDF-documents using Lua and LuaTeX
longdesc This small package provides five commands to make HTTP requests
longdesc using Lua and LuaTeX. Functionalities include API calls, fetch
longdesc RSS feeds and the possibility to include images using a link.
longdesc These commands run during the compilation of the PDF-Document
longdesc and may require user interaction.
