name marginalia
category Package
revision 74103
shortdesc Non-floating marginal content with automatic placement for LuaLaTeX
longdesc This LuaLaTeX package allows the placement of marginal content
longdesc anywhere, without \marginpar's limits, and automatically
longdesc adjusts positions to prevent overlaps or content being pushed
longdesc off the page. In short, it tries to combine the best features
longdesc from the packages marginnote, marginfix and marginfit with
longdesc key-value settings that allow fine-grained customization.
