name math-operator
category Package
revision 74351
shortdesc Predefined and new math operators
longdesc This package defines control sequences for roughly one hundred
longdesc and fifty math operators, including special functions,
longdesc probability distributions, pure mathematical constructions, and
longdesc a variant of \overline. The package also provides an interface
longdesc for users to define new math operators similar to the amsopn
longdesc package. New operators can be medium or bold weight, and they
longdesc may be declared as \mathord or \mathop subformulas.
