name mitthesis
category Package
revision 73622
shortdesc A LaTeX template for an MIT thesis
longdesc This class provides a LaTeX template for an MIT thesis or
longdesc dissertation formatted according to the requirements of the
longdesc Massachusetts Institute of Technology Libraries (as posted in
longdesc 2023):
longdesc https://libraries.mit.edu/distinctive-collections/thesis-specs/
longdesc This template is appropriate for an MIT thesis or MIT
longdesc dissertation of any type. This template works with either
longdesc pdfLaTeX or unicode engines such as LuaLaTeX. The bibliography
longdesc can be prepared with either biblatex (default) or
longdesc natbib/bibtex. The class is based on current LaTeX
longdesc distributions, ideally 11/2022 or later, but compatible with
longdesc distributions back to 2020. This template replaces the older
longdesc version of mitthesis.cls, which was first composed in the
longdesc 1980s.
