catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/fsrmatheinfo/mluexercise/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://fachschaft.mathinf.uni-halle.de/
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/fsrmatheinfo/mluexercise
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mluexercise
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics class exercise
catalogue-version 2.0

