name musixtex-fonts
category Package
revision 65517
shortdesc Fonts used by MusixTeX
longdesc These are fonts for use with MusixTeX; they are provided both
longdesc as original Metafont source, and as converted Adobe Type 1. The
longdesc bundle renders the older (Type 1 fonts only) bundle
longdesc musixtex-t1fonts obsolete.
execute addMixedMap musix.map
