name nextpage
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Generalisations of the page advance commands
longdesc Provides \clearpage and \newpage variants that guarantee to end
longdesc up on even/odd numbered pages; these 4 commands all have an
longdesc optional argument whose content will be placed on any "empty"
longdesc page generated.
