name nicefilelist
category Package
revision 65842
shortdesc Provide \listfiles alignment
longdesc The package extends longnamefilelist, keeping separate columns
longdesc for date, version and "caption" (the caption now separately
longdesc listed). Alignment is not disturbed by short file name
longdesc extensions, such as ".fd". The package is not compatible with
longdesc longnamefilelist: users need to re-read the documentation.
