catalogue-version 1.0

name notex-bst
category Package
revision 42361
shortdesc A BibTeX style that outputs HTML
longdesc noTeX.bst produces a number of beautifully formatted HTML P
longdesc elements instead of TeX code. It can be used to automatically
longdesc generate bibliographies to be served on the web starting from
longdesc BibTeX files.
runfiles size=5
 texmf-dist/bibtex/bst/notex-bst/noTeX.bst
catalogue-ctan /biblio/bibtex/utils/misc/noTeX.bst
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics bibtex-sty cvt-html

name noto
category Package
revision 64351
shortdesc Support for Noto fonts
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the NotoSerif, NotoSans and NotoSansMono families
longdesc of fonts, designed by Steve Matteson for Google.
