name odesandpdes
category Package
revision 69485
shortdesc Optimizing workflow involving odes and pdes
longdesc This package is the solution no one asked for, to a problem
longdesc nobody had. Have you ever thought to yourself "wow, I sure do
longdesc dislike having to remember multiple macros for my odes and
longdesc pdes" and the author of this package has to agree,
longdesc wholeheartedly. In the modern world of "tik-toking" and "family
longdesc guy surfing" our brains have rotted beyond salvage for even
longdesc basic levels of cognitive recall. This package aims to fix
longdesc this, through two macros that have been set to each have an
longdesc identical form and function with an emphasis on intuitive use.
longdesc Through setting options, the multiple common notational style
longdesc are easily swapped between, all by a single option. You're
longdesc Welcome.
docfiles size=71
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/odesandpdes/README.txt details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/odesandpdes/odesandpdes.pdf details="Package documentation"
srcfiles size=16
