longdesc smaller arrowheads, associated with the usual LaTeX commands.
longdesc It can be used in documents that contain other amssymb arrow
longdesc characters that also have small arrowheads. It is also possible
longdesc to use the usual new-style Computer Modern arrows together with
longdesc the old-style ones.
