name omgtudoc-asoiu
category Package
revision 74183
shortdesc A class for documents of the ASOIU department at Omsk State Technical University
longdesc This package provides a class for documents which are prepared
longdesc on the "Automatic systems for information processing and
longdesc control" (ASOIU) of Omsk State Technical University, Omsk,
longdesc Russia. The class is based on the article class and requires
longdesc XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX for its proper working. Formatting complies
longdesc with the instructions issued on January 29, 2024 and at GOST
longdesc 7.32-2017.
