name outlines
category Package
revision 25192
shortdesc Produce "outline" lists
longdesc Defines an outline environment, which allows outline-style
longdesc indented lists with freely mixed levels up to four levels deep.
longdesc It replaces the nested begin/end pairs by different item tags
longdesc \1 to \4 for each nesting level. This is very convenient in
longdesc cases where nested lists are used a lot, such as for to-do
longdesc lists or presentation slides.
docfiles size=37
