name outoruby
category Package
revision 74394
shortdesc Ruby with line break support for Japanese text
longdesc This package provides the \outoruby command, which supports
longdesc line breaks when typesetting ruby anotations. It automatically
longdesc switches between appropriate ruby forms at the beginning and
longdesc the end of lines according to JIS X 4051 and JLReq. This
longdesc package depends on pxrubrica and supports any engine that is
longdesc supported by that package.
depend pxrubrica
