name padcount
category Package
revision 47621
shortdesc Pad numbers with arbitrary characters
longdesc This package provides some simple macros which will pad numbers
longdesc (or, indeed, any expanded token) with your choice of character
longdesc (defaulting to "0") to your choice of number of places
longdesc (defaults to "2"). This works not only on arabic numerals, but
longdesc on any expanded list of tokens passed to it. This makes it
longdesc suitable for, among other things, counters of all kinds.
