name pdftex-quiet
category Package
revision 49169
shortdesc A bash wrapper for pdfTeX limiting its output to relevant errors
longdesc This package provides a bash script aiming at reducing pdfTeX's
longdesc output to relevant errors, which are displayed in a red bold
longdesc font. The project originally started as a TeX StackExchange
longdesc answer.
depend pdftex-quiet.ARCH
