name physics2
category Package
revision 69369
shortdesc Macros for typesetting maths faster and more simply
longdesc The physics2 package defines commands for typesetting maths
longdesc formulae faster and more simply. physics2 is a modularized
longdesc package, each module provides its own function. You can load
longdesc modules separately after loading physics2. Modules of physics
longdesc provide the following support: Automatic braces; Dirac bra-ket
longdesc notation; Easy way to typeset diagonal matrices and matrices
longdesc with similar entries; Double cross and double dot (binary)
longdesc operators for tensors.
