shortdesc A font for the pigpen (or masonic) cipher
longdesc The Pigpen cipher package provides the font and the necessary
longdesc wrappers (style file, etc.) in order to write Pigpen ciphers, a
longdesc simple substitution cipher. The package provides a font
longdesc (available both as Metafont source, and as an Adobe Type 1
longdesc file), and macros for its use.
