name platexcheat
category Package
revision 49557
shortdesc A LaTeX cheat sheet, in Japanese
longdesc This is a translation to Japanese of Winston Chang's LaTeX
longdesc cheat sheet (a reference sheet for writing scientific papers).
longdesc It has been adapted to Japanese standards using pLaTeX, and
longdesc also attached additional information of "standard LaTeX"
longdesc (especially about math-mode).
