name pxpgfmark
category Package
revision 30212
shortdesc e-pTeX driver for PGF inter-picture connections
longdesc The distributed drivers do not support the PGF feature of
longdesc "inter-picture connections" under e-pTeX and dvipdfmx. The
longdesc package uses existing features of dvipdfmx to fix this problem
