name pxtatescale
category Package
revision 63967
shortdesc Patch to graphics driver for scaling in vertical direction of pTeX
longdesc Patch for graphics driver 'dvipdfmx' to support correct scaling
longdesc in vertical direction of Japanese pTeX/upTeX.
