name quickreaction
category Package
revision 66867
shortdesc A simple and fast way to typeset chemical reactions
longdesc This package provides the quickreaction environment and the
longdesc \quickarrow command to simplify the typesetting of chemical
longdesc reactions. It is based on the TikZ matrix of nodes and aligns
longdesc all the reactants and products at the center of the TikZ box in
longdesc which they are contained.
