name quiver
category Package
revision 67779
shortdesc Draw commutative diagrams exported from https://q.uiver.app
longdesc Quiver is a modern graphical editor for commutative and pasting
longdesc diagrams, capable of rendering high-quality diagrams for screen
longdesc viewing, and exporting to LaTeX. This LaTeX package is intended
longdesc to be used in conjunction with the editor, and provides the
longdesc packages and styles that are used by diagrams exported from the
longdesc editor.
