name r_und_s
category Package
revision 15878
catalogue r-und-s
shortdesc Chemical hazard codes
longdesc The r_und_s package decodes the german 'R- und S-Satze', which
longdesc are numerically coded security advice for chemical substances
longdesc into plain text. This is, e.g., used to compose security sheets
longdesc or lab protocols and especially useful for students of
longdesc chemistry. There are four packages, giving texts in German,
longdesc English, French and Dutch.
docfiles size=2
 texmf-dist/doc/latex/r_und_s/README details="Readme"
