name randbild
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Marginal pictures
longdesc Provides environments randbild to draw small marginal plots
longdesc (using the packages pstricks and pst-plot), and randbildbasis
longdesc (the same, only without the automatically drawn coordinate
longdesc system).
