revision 43505
shortdesc Hacks to make writing quantum papers for revtex4-1 less painful
longdesc This package provides a number of useful hacks to solve common
longdesc annoyances with the revtex4-1 package, and to define notation
longdesc in common use within quantum information. In doing so, it
longdesc imports and configures a number of commonly-available and used
longdesc packages, and where reasonable, provides fallbacks. It also
longdesc warns when users try to load packages which are known to be
longdesc incompatible with revtex4-1.
