name rit-fonts
category Package
revision 67659
shortdesc Malayalam fonts by Rachana Institute of Typography (RIT)
longdesc The RIT font collection provides versions of ten font families
longdesc in Malayalam (the language spoken in the southern Indian state
longdesc of Kerala) script in TrueType and WOFF2 formats. The fonts are:
longdesc RIT Rachana RIT Panmana RIT MeeraNew RIT TN Joy RIT Karuna RIT
longdesc Keralayeeam RIT Sundar RIT Uroob RIT Ezhuthu RIT Kutty A LaTeX
longdesc package rit-fonts.sty that will help users to make use of these
longdesc Unicode-compliant fonts in LaTeX documents with XeTeX or LuaTeX
longdesc is also provided.
