name scratch
category Package
revision 66655
shortdesc Draw programs like "scratch"
longdesc This package is now obsolete. From now on, scratch at
longdesc scratch.mit.edu is now version3 with a new design. Please, use
longdesc the "scratch3" package to draw blocks with the new design. This
longdesc package permits to draw program charts in the style of the
longdesc scatch project (scratch.mit.edu). It depends on the other LaTeX
longdesc packages TikZ and simplekv.
