runfiles size=2
 texmf-dist/tex/latex/semantic-markup/semantic-markup.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/semantic-markup
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics humanities linguistic

name semaphor
category Package
revision 18651
shortdesc Semaphore alphabet font
longdesc These fonts represent semaphore in a highly schematic, but very
longdesc clear, fashion. The fonts are provided as Metafont source, and
longdesc in both OpenType and Adobe Type 1 formats.
