name semesterplannerlua
category Package
revision 71322
shortdesc Draw timetables and other organizational matters useful for planning a semester
longdesc This LaTeX package provides commands to print timetables, lists
longdesc of appointments and exams. Also it is possible to draw
longdesc calendars of specified ranges (and mark dates which were
longdesc previously listed). Drawing the timetable is based on TikZ,
longdesc which makes it very flexible.
