name skb
category Package
revision 22781
shortdesc Tools for a repository of long-living documents
longdesc The package provides macros that help to build a document
longdesc repository for long living documents. It focuses on structure
longdesc and re-use of text, code, figures etc. The basic concept is
longdesc first to separate structure from content (i.e., text about a
longdesc topic from the structure it is presented by) and then
longdesc separating the content from the actual published document, thus
longdesc enabling easy re-use of text blocks in different publications
longdesc (i.e., text about a protocol in a short article about this
longdesc protocol as well as in a book about many protocols); all
longdesc without constantly copying or changing text. As a side effect,
longdesc using the document classes provided, it hides a lot of LaTeX
longdesc from someone who just wants to write articles and books.
