longdesc thesis. The author developed it while writing his PhD thesis in
longdesc School of Computing (SoC), National University of Singapore
longdesc (NUS). By default, the class adheres to the NUS Guidelines on
longdesc Format of Research Thesis Submitted For Examination. However,
longdesc the class for conformation to a different guideline should not
longdesc be difficult.
