name stellenbosch
category Package
revision 68039
shortdesc Stellenbosch thesis bundle (legacy version)
longdesc Note: This bundle should only be used for typesetting legacy
longdesc documents. For new documents, its successor stellenbosch-2 is
longdesc available. The usthesis class/style files are provided to
longdesc typeset reports, theses and dissertations that conform to the
longdesc requirements of the Engineering Faculty of the University of
longdesc Stellenbosch. The class file usthesis.cls is based on the
longdesc standard LaTeX book class, while usthesis.sty is a style file
longdesc to be loaded on top of the very powerful memoir class. Both
longdesc options give identical output, but the benefit of the using
longdesc memoir is that it has many additional command and environments
longdesc for formatting and processing of a document. Usthesis is
longdesc primarily concerned with the formatting of the front matter
longdesc such as the title page, abstract, etc. and a decent page layout
longdesc on A4 paper. It also works together with the babel package to
longdesc provide language options to typeset documents in Afrikaans or
longdesc in English. Additional packages are provided for bibliographic
longdesc matter, note title pages, lists of symbols, as well as various
longdesc graphic files for logos.
