name tableaux
category Package
revision 42413
shortdesc Construct tables of signs and variations
longdesc The package uses PSTricks; the user may define the width of the
longdesc table, the number of lines and the height of each line.
longdesc Placement of labels within the boxes may be absolute, or as a
longdesc percentage of the width; various other controls are available.
