longdesc quadro (for tables with text information). Additional
longdesc environments abnttblr, tallabnttblr, and longabnttblr are
longdesc wrappers to tblr, talltblr, and longtblr that apply the abnt
longdesc theme automatically and permit to set the table font using
longdesc \SetAbntTblrFont{} provided here.
