name tempora
category Package
revision 39596
shortdesc Greek and Cyrillic to accompany Times
longdesc This package, derived from TemporaLGCUni by Alexej Kryukov, is
longdesc meant as a companion to Times text font packages, providing
longdesc Greek and Cyrillic in matching weights and styles. OpenType and
longdesc Type1 fonts are provided, with LaTeX support files giving
longdesc essentially complete LGR coverage of monotonic, polytonic and
longdesc ancient Greek, and almost full T2A coverage of Cyrillic.
