name termmenu
category Package
revision 37700
shortdesc The package provides support for terminal-based menus using expl3
longdesc When writing programs, it's often required to present the user
longdesc with a list of options/actions. The user is then expected to
longdesc select one of these options for the program to process.
longdesc termmenu provides this mechanism for TeX. It requires only
longdesc expl3 support, thus the l3kernel and l3packages are both
longdesc required.
