name tex-font-errors-cheatsheet
category Package
revision 18314
shortdesc Cheat sheet outlining the most common TeX font errors
longdesc This is a compact three-pages document highlighting the TeX
longdesc flow of integrating fonts, and explains how some of the most
longdesc common font-related error messages occur. Also, hints are given
longdesc on how to address those.
