name texapi
category Package
revision 54080
shortdesc Macros to write format-independent packages
longdesc Texapi provides utility macros to write format-independent (and
longdesc -aware) packages. It is similar in spirit to the etoolbox,
longdesc except that it isn't tied to LaTeX. Tools include: engine and
longdesc format detection, expansion control, command definition and
longdesc manipulation, various testing macros, string operations, and
longdesc highly customizable while and for loops. The package requires
longdesc e-TeX (and, should you want to compile its documentation, the
longdesc pitex package is also needed).
docfiles size=48
 texmf-dist/doc/generic/texapi/README details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/generic/texapi/texapi-doc.pdf details="Package documentation"
 texmf-dist/doc/generic/texapi/texapi-doc.tex
runfiles size=8
 texmf-dist/tex/generic/texapi/texapi.tex
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/texapi
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics macro-supp etex
catalogue-version 1.04

name texblend
category Package
revision 68961
shortdesc Compile segments of LaTeX documents
longdesc This tool compiles individual files that are included as parts
longdesc of larger documents. It utilizes the preamble of the main
longdesc document but disregards all other included files. The main
longdesc purpose is to allow fast compilation of particular chapters or
longdesc sections, eliminating the need to recompile the entire
longdesc document. This facilitates an efficient way to check for
longdesc formatting or syntax errors in the particular part of the
longdesc document being worked on.
depend texblend.ARCH
docfiles size=17
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texblend/README details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texblend/intro.tex
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texblend/texblend-doc.pdf details="Package documentation"
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texblend/texblend-doc.tex
 texmf-dist/doc/support/texblend/usage.tex
runfiles size=3
 texmf-dist/scripts/texblend/texblend
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/michal-h21/texblend
catalogue-contact-home https://www.kodymirus.cz/texblend/
catalogue-ctan /support/texblend
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics compilation cond-comp comp-mgmt use-lua
catalogue-version 0.1

