name texbytopic
category Package
revision 68950
shortdesc Freed version of the book TeX by Topic
longdesc An invaluable book, originally published by Addison-Wesley (who
longdesc have released their copyright -- their version of the book went
longdesc out of print in the 1990s). The book describes itself as "a
longdesc TeXnician's reference", and covers the way TeX (the engine)
longdesc works in as much detail as most ordinary TeX programmers will
longdesc ever need to know. A printed copy of the book, slightly
longdesc updated, may be had (for a modest price) from DANTE. The
longdesc original edition is available from Lulu. See the package home
longdesc page for details.
docfiles size=559
 texmf-dist/doc/plain/texbytopic/README details="Readme"
 texmf-dist/doc/plain/texbytopic/TeXbyTopic.pdf details="The book itself"
 texmf-dist/doc/plain/texbytopic/TeXbyTopic.tex
