name tikz-palattice
category Package
revision 43442
shortdesc Draw particle accelerator lattices with TikZ
longdesc This package allows for drawing a map of a particle accelerator
longdesc just by giving a list of elements -- similar to lattice files
longdesc for simulation software. The package includes 12 common element
longdesc types like dipoles, quadrupoles, cavities, or screens, as well
longdesc as automatic labels with element names, a legend, a rule, and
longdesc an environment to fade out parts of the accelerator. The
longdesc coordinate of any element can be saved and used for custom TikZ
longdesc drawings or annotations. Thereby, lattices can be connected to
longdesc draw injection/extraction or even a complete accelerator
longdesc facility.
