name timechart
category Package
revision 74010
shortdesc A package for drawing chronological charts
longdesc This package provides for the easy creation of chronological
longdesc charts which show visually the relative historical positions of
longdesc people and events. Each event or period can be specified by a
longdesc single line of LaTeX code comprising (possibly uncertain) start
longdesc and finish dates and a label, and the package takes care of
longdesc indicating the uncertainties and whether intervals extend
longdesc beyond the specified bounds of the chart.
