name titleref
category Package
revision 18729
shortdesc A "\titleref" command to cross-reference section titles
longdesc Defines a command \titleref that allows you to cross-reference
longdesc section (and chapter, etc) titles and captions just like \ref
longdesc and \pageref. The package does not interwork with hyperref; if
longdesc you need hypertext capabilities, use nameref instead.
