name to-be-determined
category Package
revision 72527
shortdesc Highlight text passages that need further work
longdesc This package provides a single command \tbd which highlights
longdesc the pieces of text that need to be rewritten later. You can
longdesc hide them all with a single package option hide, or just make
longdesc them disappear entirely with the option off.
depend soul
depend xcolor
