name udepcolor
category Package
revision 69701
shortdesc University of Piura (UDEP) institutional and corporate colors for digital and electronic media
longdesc This package defines University of Piura (UDEP) institutional
longdesc and corporate colors for digital and electronic media according
longdesc to brand and style guidelines published by UDEP DIRCOM. The
longdesc colors have been selected and implemented using the xcolor
longdesc package and following the brand and visual identity guidelines
longdesc of the University of Piura.
