catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ulem
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics underline emphasis

name ulqda
category Package
revision 26313
shortdesc Support of Qualitative Data Analysis
longdesc The package is for use in Qualitative Data Analysis research.
longdesc It supports the integration of Qualitative Data Analysis (QDA)
longdesc research tasks, specifically for Grounded Theory, into the
longdesc LaTeX work flow. It assists in the analysis of textual data
longdesc such as interview transcripts and field notes by providing the
longdesc LaTeX user with macros which are used to markup textual
longdesc information -- for example, in-depth interviews.
depend ulqda.ARCH
