name utf8add
category Package
revision 61074
shortdesc Additional support for UTF-8 encoded LaTeX input
longdesc This bundle contains the LaTeX packages utf8add.sty and
longdesc utf8hax.sty. The utf8add package provides additional support
longdesc for the use of UTF-8 encoded input. This is intended for making
longdesc LaTeX input more readable. The utf8hax package is using UTF-8
longdesc characters for easier access to math in LaTeX, however making
longdesc the LaTeX input less readable.
